# Frontend tools install under .github/; ignore dependency trees at any depth.
# The product build and Go package graph need no Node.
node_modules/
# A clean clone receives the code, its build inputs, the judge rule inventory,
# and the documents a contributor needs to work here: how to build and test it,
# what a pull request must contain, and what an agent opening one may and may
# not touch. The maintainer's own process, authoring, and design notes stay on
# the maintainer's machine, out of history. Each redistributed asset carries
# its licence text beside it under assets/.
# tests/ holds local harness self-tests; yomihon's Go tests live in
# internal/*_test.go.
.claude/
.agents/
.codex/
.lsp.json
tests/
/AGENT_INTERFACE.md
